---
layout: "base.njk"
permalink: "/images/logo/"
title: "Logo downloads — SciStitch"
description: "Download SciStitch’s logo in vector and PNG formats, including wordmarks, symbols, social avatars, and a sharing banner."
---
<section class="section-pad container" aria-labelledby="logo-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Brand assets</p>
      <h1 id="logo-title">SciStitch logo kit</h1>
    </div>
    <p>Vector originals and PNG exports for presentations, partner materials, and social media. SVG lettering is outlined and needs no installed fonts.</p>
  </div>
  <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/images/logo/scistitch-logo-kit.zip" download>Download the complete kit ↓</a></p>
  <div class="section-note">
    <p>Keep the proportions and colors intact, leave clear space, and choose a version with good contrast. White artwork is previewed on a dark background.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/images/logo/usage.txt">Usage notes ↗</a>
  </div>
  <div class="engagement-grid">
    {% for asset in logoAssets %}
    <article>
      <h2>{{ asset.label }}</h2>
      <img src="/images/logo/{{ asset.name }}.svg" width="{{ asset.width }}" height="{{ asset.height }}" alt="{{ asset.label }} SciStitch logo" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;height:180px;object-fit:contain;margin-block:24px;padding:16px;background:{{ asset.background }};border:1px solid #d9ddd9" />
      <p>{{ asset.details }}</p>
      <div class="inline-links">
        <a href="/images/logo/{{ asset.name }}.svg" download>SVG ↓</a>
        <a href="/images/logo/{{ asset.name }}.png" download>PNG ↓</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
